AXALL_US_OMB_2025_00074,US_OMB_2025_00074,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Homeland Security,IT,UNKNOWN,ChatCBP,Department of Homeland Security; CBP; IT; United States,"Generative LLM that will allow users to upload, search, delete, summarize documents, conduct advanced searches, and identify similar language in documents and receive natural language-style outputs in response to their prompts.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Improving Operational Efficiency: Automating information retrieval, reducing manual review time, and streamlining workflows will lead to significant time savings and increased productivity for CBP personnel. This translates to cost savings and allows agents to focus on higher-priority tasks. _x000D_ _x000D_ Enhancing Decision-Making: Providing quick and accurate access to relevant information will improve the quality and consistency of decisions across the agency. _x000D_ _x000D_ Increasing Mission Effectiveness: By applying LLM capabilities to critical use cases like hot list review and violation coding, we can enhance accuracy, reduce errors, and improve overall mission success rates.",Workforce enablement and efficiency.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DHS-2530,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
