AXALL_US_OMB_2025_00078,US_OMB_2025_00078,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Homeland Security,Law Enforcement,"Analyze X-Ray images and predict the commodity code, reducing the need for users to manually enter commodity codes.",Commodity Detection Model (Cargo Insights Team),Department of Homeland Security; CBP; Law Enforcement; United States,"The system applies a prediction label alongside a bounding box on record. Officers use this information along with all information provided to determine what, if any, further steps are required.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,This project leverages computer vision with object detection and a neural network to analyze X-Ray images and predict the commodity code.,"This enhances border security and optimizes resource allocation for inspections. Analyze X-Ray images and predict the commodity code, reducing the need for users to manually enter commodity codes.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,S5_OPTIMIZATION_DECISION_SUPPORT,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DHS-69,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
