AXALL_US_OMB_2025_00240,US_OMB_2025_00240,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""enterprise_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Homeland Security,IT,"Reduce the manual investigation/intervention to configure, monitor and troubleshooting issues.",Enterprise WiFi,Department of Homeland Security; USSS; IT; United States,"To automate wireless operations, improve reliability, predictability, and visibility into user experiences. Additionally, it lists the core technical features, such as spatial streams, channel bandwidth, modulation techniques, and advanced operational capabilities, ensuring clarity and relevance for technical and professional audiences.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Reduced time to resolve reported network issues and outages.,"Reduce the manual investigation/intervention to configure, monitor and troubleshooting issues.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DHS-2641,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_00241,US_OMB_2025_00241,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Homeland Security,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,Criminal Investigations (OBIM),Department of Homeland Security; USSS; Law Enforcement; United States,The system will query image galleries of known persons and may provide lists of potential matches. USSS personnel may use the potential matches to produce investigative leads which will assist in the further identification of victims or suspects.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The intended purpose of this AI is so that USSS personnel may submit available photographs or video stills of these unknown persons as probe images (facial images or templates searched against the gallery of an FRS) to other government agencies for comparison against their image galleries. The agencies will query their image galleries of known persons and may provide lists of potential matches. They may use the potential matches to produce investigative leads which will assist in the further identification of victims or suspects. Additionally, we may request another government agency to conduct a one-to-one comparison of two photographs or video stills for investigative use.","The intended problem to solve is the identification of unknown victims and suspects involved in crimes that undermine the integrity of U.S. financial and payment systems. By using facial recognition and biometric image comparison, the USSS aims to efficiently and accurately identify individuals connected to criminal investigations, thereby supporting law enforcement efforts to detect, arrest, and prevent such crimes.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DHS-415,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_00242,US_OMB_2025_00242,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Homeland Security,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,License Plate Reader,Department of Homeland Security; USSS; Law Enforcement; United States,"Optical Character Recognition (OCR) technology is utilized to detect and interpret the alphanumeric characters on the license plate. The extracted license plate information serves as a decision support tool, aiding investigators by highlighting possible characters and combinations. This allows investigators to efficiently generate and verify leads while complementing their independent analysis.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The purpose of identifying license plate information from low-quality imagery is to enable accurate and efficient vehicle identification for applications such as law enforcement, traffic monitoring, parking management, border security, and access control, ensuring operational efficiency and enhanced security.","To identify license plate information quickly, efficiently, and accurately from low-quality imagery, advanced image processing and machine learning techniques are typically employed. Need to be able to enhance the clarity of the image, correct distortions, and extract relevant details, even in challenging conditions such as low resolution, poor lighting, motion blur, or obstructions.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DHS-2626,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
