AXALL_US_OMB_2025_00846,US_OMB_2025_00846,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of the Interior,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,Everlaw AI Assistant for Responsive Review,Department of the Interior; OCIO; Admin Functions; United States,"The AI assistant provides one of four coding suggestions: Yes (direct match), Soft Yes (plausible relevance), Soft No (weak relevance), or No (not relevant). DOI reviewers can filter by category, validate samples, and refine code descriptions. Output is advisory; reviewers decide whether to apply the ‘Responsive’ code.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Reduced manual labor cost and cycle time for responsive review; more consistent and rapid identification of responsive documents; meet discovery deadlines; large scale document search; and improved classification for historical accounting.,"Everlaw AI Assistant’s Coding Suggestions lets OTAR and DO set natural-language criteria (case, category, and code descriptions) to assess document responsiveness. By tagging documents using keywords, account numbers, and contextual clues, it reduces manual review and speeds document triage",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOI-0170,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_00847,US_OMB_2025_00847,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of the Interior,Procurement and Finance Mgmt,UNKNOWN,FBMS UPC Chatbot,Department of the Interior; OCIO; Procurement and Finance Mgmt; United States,"The correct UPC will be provided to the requestor and used on the Purchase Request in FBMS. Longer term solution would be for the auto generation of the Purchase request with the correct UPC pre-populated on the PR. It is also, still imperative that the FBMS user responsible for the PR must also validate the UPC as well as the IT Approver.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,DOI staff that initiate purchase requests will interact with the UPC Chatbot Assistant so that the correct UPC code is used especially when planned purchases are IT related.,"An OIG draft finding identified a significant number of purchase requests where the ""Other"" UPCs were used instead of the IT related UPCs that would trigger an IT Approval. This misclassification undermines OCIO's ability to track IT spending",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOI-0057,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
