AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01152,US_OMB_2025_01152,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,Summarizing Inspection Actions and Results for Future Inspectors,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / DEA; Admin Functions; United States,A rough draft of inspection results would be generated for review and approval.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Distilling large data sets, interpreting graphs, writing final reports, and summarizing results is time consuming. An AI prompt can assist in creation of a rough draft in significantly less time as opposed to the time and effort commitment from DEA's human capital resources. Cost savings could be achieved from reduced full-time equivalents spent on generating end user products. In addition, the turnaround time involved with many inspection result findings work processes would decrease.",The Office of Inspection (IN) is leveraging the Business Improvement Section (ACB) to automate a large number of their work processes.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0254,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
