AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01154,US_OMB_2025_01154,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,Fingerprint (Friction Ridge) Optical Character Recognition (OCR),Department of Justice; Department of Justice / DEA; Law Enforcement; United States,Outputs images and portions of print cards.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,This use case saves time and provides information for human decision-making.,"DEA, when conducting fingerprint analysis to identify individuals who may be connected to evidence, needs to be able to compare friction ridge prints to other prints within the boundaries of a case. Product enables linking of cases where individuals are not necessarily identified.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0296,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01155,US_OMB_2025_01155,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,Extracting Data from Receipts to Speed Travel Reimbursement or Provide Logbook Documentation,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / DEA; Admin Functions; United States,The output is a CSV file.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Cost savings, live data entry of OGV use (miles and fuel consumption), streamlining of voucher packet creation",Gas receipts need to be reconciled / logged into FIRM – the AI would capture the data and can be used to record the receipt (reducing loss of paper) and eventually upload into FIRM reducing human data entry and time. IN also inspects receipts as part of their inspection. The laboratories also audit their OGV logbooks more than once annually. This would be a great pilot to expand into scanning and recording information from other purchases into UFMS and automate that process as well.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0297,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01156,US_OMB_2025_01156,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Law Enforcement,"It is often challenging for DEA employees to manually search through our voluminous collection of manuals, books, CBP chemical codes, CFR, U.S.C., etc.",Chatbot to Answer Internal Employee Policy Queries,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / DEA; Law Enforcement; United States,"The solution will enable users to ask questions through a chatbot interface, where the AI system, trained on the Agents Manual, will generate comprehensive answers and recommendations. These responses will be sourced from all relevant materials and include hyperlinks to the original references for easy access and verification.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"AI can provide comprehensiveness answers to employees' questions much more quickly than if the employees had to search and find the answers themselves. In addition, the AI can identify content that needs to be revised or added to effectively provide answers.","It is often challenging for DEA employees to manually search through our voluminous collection of manuals, books, CBP chemical codes, CFR, U.S.C., etc. to find an answer to their specific questions about policy, law, and rules. Training the AI on these materials enables it to answer employee queries comprehensively and quickly, thereby saving employees a lot of time.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0316,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01157,US_OMB_2025_01157,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,Audio and Written Transcription and Translation,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / DEA; Law Enforcement; United States,Outputs transcription of the original language and the English translation with speaker differentiations including search results of the predetermined relevant terms defined by the analyst.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The immediate benefits are speed and lower cost, and to enable investigators to quickly identify which parts of the conversations should be reviewed and interpreted by human translators.",This technology automates the transcription and translation of Spanish and Mandarin Chinese audio files from lawfully seized devices and authorized communications.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0329,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
