AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01320,US_OMB_2025_01320,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,IT,UNKNOWN,AI Sandbox for exploration and education on AI,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / OJP; IT; United States,Risks assessments Recommendations Decision,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Enhance OJP workforce to work faster Reduce number of software that AI can achieve Improving access to data,Help identify enhancement in mission capabilities Explore Risk management Help identify AI Use cases with OJP Educate AI enable workforce,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0342,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01321,US_OMB_2025_01321,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,NetDocuments,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / OPR; Admin Functions; United States,The AI output from NetDocuments consists of predictive recommendations for the specific OPR matter numbers to which OPR staff should associate files saved into NetDocuments.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Because NetDocuments is OPR's repository of records, it is important that OPR staff save all matter-related files into NetDocuments associated with the correct OPR matter number. The AI feature in NetDocuments is expected to make the process of saving files into NetDocuments more efficient and user-friendly. That will both encourage end users to save files into NetDocuments and assist in making sure that files are correctly associated with the proper OPR matter numbers.","The AI functionality of NetDocuments consists of predictive suggestions for saving files, such as Word documents and Outlook emails. Through machine learning, NetDocuments predicts the OPR matter into which it thinks the end user should save a specific file. The AI feature is intended to make the process of saving files into the pertinent matter number more efficient and streamlined.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0279,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01322,US_OMB_2025_01322,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,Adobe,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / PAO; Admin Functions; United States,"Images, if feature were in use",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Adobe has function that enables the generation of images. PAO does not use this function/feature.,"DOJ needs to communicate effectively internally and externally. This tool, can support image production for communication purposes.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0208,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
