AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01328,US_OMB_2025_01328,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,"Voicemail Transcription, Translation and Summarization",Department of Justice; Department of Justice / PARDON; Admin Functions; United States,"The primary output from this use case is an email that provides an AI generated summary of the voicemail and includes the following attachments: the original voicemail (.wav file), a text file that includes the transcribed voicemail, and a text file that includes the translated voicemail (for non-English voicemails). This email is sent to the shared PARDON inbox and processed with other email requests.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Cost savings, reducing customer wait times, improving customer experiences, improving PARDON Attorney experiences, and improving multi-lingual access to the government.","PARDON would like to leverage transcription, translation and summarization services available in the GCC high cloud environment to help reduce the processing time and level of effort associated with responding to voicemail inquiries.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0243,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01329,US_OMB_2025_01329,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,ProLaw,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / PRAO; Law Enforcement; United States,"ProLaw's output is information. Specifically, PRAO uses ProLaw to identify all of the digital inquiry files in the database that are consistent with the user's selected search query.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The benefits of ProLaw is that it enables PRAO to store digitally, consistent with the component's records retention schedule, all PRAO inquiry files and then quickly search large quantities of inquiry files to identify relevant historical inquiries and advice to a current matter a PRAO attorney is working on. This greatly reduces the amount of time it takes PRAO staff to research which then reduces the wait time of the Department attorney who has requested PRAO advice. Because ProLaw allows PRAO to store records digitally, it also provides government cost savings in the amount of money paid to store hard copy records.",ProLaw assists PRAO attorneys in searching a large quantity of prior PRAO inquiries and advice (stored within the database) to identify relevant historical inquiry files that will assist the attorneys in determining how PRAO has advised on similar matters in the past.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0266,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
