AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01331,US_OMB_2025_01331,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,AWS Translate,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / TAX; Law Enforcement; United States,Machine translated text,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Machine translation facilitates faster review of foreign language documents. Permits selection of key documents to be sent to vendors for evaluation and translation, speeding up review considerably and saving funds that would otherwise be spent on translation vendors.",Creates machine translation of foreign language documents to facilitate review and evaluation of evidence.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0221,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
