AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01344,US_OMB_2025_01344,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Justice,Law Enforcement,The AI is intended to reduce manual work effort and reduce the time it takes to redact video and audio footage.,Axon Video Retention Solution (VRS) - object recognition and redaction,Department of Justice; Department of Justice / USMS; Law Enforcement; United States,"Draft video file with USMS-selected desired redaction areas (faces, license plates or computer terminals) Note: Redacted file is not complete until human intervention validates and/or corrects AI suggestions.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,This product allows for the protection of identities of Law Enforcement Officers and the public. The only subjects not blurred/redacted are of the target(s) of the arrest. In addition the expected benefits for using the object recognition capability includes reduced USMS personnel time required to produce redacted footage and obviate the need to procure outside redaction services.,"The Object Recognition AI capabilities present in the Axon Evidence Redaction suite creates first-pass results for potential desired redactions of individual's faces, license plates and computer terminals. The AI is intended to reduce manual work effort and reduce the time it takes to redact video and audio footage.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOJ-0225,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
