AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01377,US_OMB_2025_01377,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Labor,Other - Applied Mathematical Sciences,Non-actionable submissions increase the burden on those tasked with reviewing comments.,Comment Actionability Likelihood Score,Department of Labor; BLS; Other - Applied Mathematical Sciences; United States,The output is a logistic regression model's predicted probability that a comment would be labeled as actionable feedback for the agency.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,The tool reduces the burden on those tasked with reviewing these comments by providing them with a means to sort them by how actionable they are likely to be.,"Many comments submitted through the BLS.gov customer satisfaction survey are not actionable (i.e., do not provide an issue or explanation of what could improve the user experience). Non-actionable submissions increase the burden on those tasked with reviewing comments.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOL-40,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01378,US_OMB_2025_01378,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Labor,Other - Applied Mathematical Sciences,"Every year, thousands of collected data must be reviewed manually by human staff.",Computer-Assisted Review: ORS Autocoder,Department of Labor; BLS; Other - Applied Mathematical Sciences; United States,SOC code,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Efficiency and data quality improvements,"The Occupational Requirements Survey (ORS) collects and publishes information about specific work-related requirements. Every year, thousands of collected data must be reviewed manually by human staff. The ORS Autocoder, on a regular basis, autocodes and clears certain edit flags from records which it deems to be good, allowing human staff to focus on reviewing data that are more likely to be incorrect.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOL-41,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
