AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01474,US_OMB_2025_01474,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Transportation,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,Public Comment Analyzer (PCA),Department of Transportation; OST; Admin Functions; United States,Data is available on Regulations.gov.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,The anticipated benefits are: Improve the accuracy of the analysis; reduction of human analysis required to review all public comments; streamline the process of reviewing comments; keep feedback up to date to help inform decision making. It will allow subject matter experts (SMEs) to more quickly review summaries of the submitted comments and obtain additional details where and as needed. It will also provide SMEs with the general sentiments of public comments,"The business goal of this project is to use a powerful language model to analyze public comments. The model will: • Categorize comments into different topics • Detect the sentiment (positive, negative, or neutral) of the comments • Generate summaries of the comments • Provide daily updates on the comments • Allow secure access to the information",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,DOT-1000084,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
