AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01711,US_OMB_2025_01711,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,General Services Administration,Service Delivery,"The AI is intended to solve the problem of users struggling to quickly find help and support documentation within the extensive FCP system. The Virtual Assistant aims to streamline access to this vast volume of support information, providing quicker answers to common support questions and alleviating the burden on human support staff.",FAS Catalog Platform - Virtual Assistant,General Services Administration; Service Delivery; United States,UNKNOWN,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,UNKNOWN,"The AI is intended to solve the problem of users struggling to quickly find help and support documentation within the extensive FCP system. Currently, users often resort to contacting the Vendor Support Center (VSC) instead of sifting through existing user guides, FAQs, and quick reference guides. The Virtual Assistant aims to streamline access to this vast volume of support information, providing quicker answers to common support questions and alleviating the burden on human support staff.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,UNKNOWN,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
