AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01742,US_OMB_2025_01742,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,General Services Administration,Procurement and Finance Mgmt,UNKNOWN,Solicitation Review Tool - Section 508,General Services Administration; Procurement and Finance Mgmt; United States,"It aims to automate the detection of ICT-related solicitations and then check for Section 508 compliance, improving the accessibility of government IT acquisitions.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,UNKNOWN,"The AI is intended to solve the problem of ensuring that federal solicitations for Information and Communication Technology (ICT) include adequate Section 508 compliance requirements to support accessibility in federal IT. It aims to automate the detection of ICT-related solicitations and then check for Section 508 compliance, improving the accessibility of government IT acquisitions.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,UNKNOWN,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
