AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01966,US_OMB_2025_01966,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Health and Human Services,IT,"The SAM.gov RFI Comment Analysis POC solves the problem that CMS procurement staff currently must manually review and score vendor responses to Requests for Information (RFI) posted on SAM.gov, which is time-intensive, especially when there are many questions and many vendors responding.",SAM.gov RFI Comment Analysis POC,Department of Health and Human Services; HHS/CMS/OIT; IT; United States,The AI system outputs vendor scoring and ranking reports,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The RFI Comment Analysis POC will enable CMS teams to systematically evaluate vendor responses using AI-powered analysis, improving the efficiency of assessments.","The SAM.gov RFI Comment Analysis POC solves the problem that CMS procurement staff currently must manually review and score vendor responses to Requests for Information (RFI) posted on SAM.gov, which is time-intensive, especially when there are many questions and many vendors responding.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,UNKNOWN,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
