AXALL_US_OMB_2025_01989,US_OMB_2025_01989,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Health and Human Services,Health and Medical,UNKNOWN,Renamed: Application References Previously: Application-DMF Reference,Department of Health and Human Services; HHS/FDA/CDER; Health and Medical; United States,Support information extraction from unstructured documents,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Extracts references to Drug Master Files (DMFs) from marketing application submissions including Abbreviated New Drug Applications (ANDA), New Drug Applications (NDA), and Biologics License Applications (BLA). These submission documents may be structured (356H form) or unstructured (electronic Common Technical Document modules 1-4). This pipeline parses content from these documents, extracts DMF references (e.g., ANDA123456 references DMF123456), and exposes the data in a structured format for analysis.","FDA receives extensive drug application submissions that contain valuable references to related applications, but these relationships aren't always captured in existing regulatory databases.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,UNKNOWN,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
