AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02057,US_OMB_2025_02057,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Health and Human Services,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,HRSA Fact Sheets,Department of Health and Human Services; HHS/HRSA; Admin Functions; United States,Provides HRSA Facts Sheets that are validated and can also embed additional comments so that public can get to understand this data and information better,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Public can immediately find clear, authoritative facts about HRSA programs, funding, workforce, outcomes. Also Strengthens grant proposals, community outreach, and health planning based on accurate, timely information",Generate HRSA’s Program Fact Sheets for public use and reduce the cycle time by eliminating manual review and validation process.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,UNKNOWN,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02058,US_OMB_2025_02058,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Health and Human Services,Admin Functions,"Help users get relevant information quickly instead of in lengthy manuals, FAQs, or scattered documentation and reduce support cost.",Program Reporting System Knowledge base Chatbot,Department of Health and Human Services; HHS/HRSA; Admin Functions; United States,AI chatbot integrated with post award performance reporting system which serves as a knowledge base for FAQs and system step by step guides. Both grantees and internal HRSA users will use the chatbot to get relevant information faster. The AI chatbot will eventually reduce customer support cost.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Provides instant, accurate answers to user queries, reducing the time spent searching for information. Additionally, it reduces call center support costs and minimizes the number of calls from grantees seeking system help, improving operational efficiency.","Help users get relevant information quickly instead of in lengthy manuals, FAQs, or scattered documentation and reduce support cost.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,UNKNOWN,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
