AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02140,US_OMB_2025_02140,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Health and Human Services,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,eSlate Bot,Department of Health and Human Services; HHS/NIH; Admin Functions; United States,"This tool outputs answers to questions about the quality of study section nomination slates of standing study section members, and if there are potential issues, allows the user to more closely examine the content of the nomination slate directly.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,CSR leadership can make quick decisions about slate approval and make any further improvements to slate review process,This tool answers questions using genAI by pulling information directly from the eSlate nomination packages.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,UNKNOWN,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
