AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02205,US_OMB_2025_02205,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Housing and Urban Development,Service Delivery,UNKNOWN,Voice of the Customer,Department of Housing and Urban Development; Office of the Chief Financial Officer (OCFO); Service Delivery; United States,"Text visualizations in reports/dashboards to trend, baseline, and identify key drivers of overall customer sentiment and service delivery performance.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The Voice of the Customer application brings the best-in-class voice transcription, speech, and text analytics to customer feedback surveys, contact center calls and chats. It allows HUD to unlock critical insights that provide deeper understanding of how to support and manage our program/service delivery and contact center providers, and ultimately to improve customers’ experiences.","The Office of the Chief Financial Officer, Customer Experience Team works across the department to develop a deep understanding of who our customers are and how we can best serve their needs.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,HUD-2024-004,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
