AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02243,US_OMB_2025_02243,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,Biological and Physical Sciences (BPS) RNA Sequencing Benchmark Training Dataset,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; ARC: Ames Research Center; Science; United States,The implementation uses classification methods and hierarchical clustering to identify genes that are predictive of outcomes.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,The implementation uses classification methods and hierarchical clustering to identify genes that are predictive of outcomes.,"RNA sequencing data from spaceflown and control mouse liver samples, sourced from NASA GeneLab and augmented with generative adversarial network to provide synthetic data points.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-411,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02244,US_OMB_2025_02244,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,NIR spectroscopy-based analytical tool for immediate determination of chemical signature,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; ARC: Ames Research Center; Science; United States,NIR (Near IR) spectroscopy is a spectroscopic method that uses the near-infrared region of the electromagnetic spectrum (from 780 nm to 2500 nm). Every material has their unique spectra.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Importance: NIR is well-suited for soft matter research in space because- 1. It doesn’t require any sample preparation 2. It doesn’t need gravity driven flow 3. Form factor can be of the order of a matchbox Challenges: There is no tool presently available that can perform spectral decomposition to achieve the goals,Goals: Develop AI/ML based tool that can identify materials composition and size distribution “on the fly”,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-414,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02245,US_OMB_2025_02245,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,Improved Differential Dynamic Microscopy (DDM) tool for characterization of soft matter,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; ARC: Ames Research Center; Science; United States,"DDM is an optical microscopy method that can use high speed imaging with data analysis to analyze soft active media (e.g.- colloidal particles, polymers, biological samples etc.)",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Importance: DDM is well-suited for soft matter research in space because- 1. It only needs regular microscopy system 2. Can be extremely modular and can be fitted in form factor as small as cube sat Challenges: The present methodology for DDM analysis require long time (~20- 30 minutes) for processing images &amp; decomposition of signal is a challenge,Goals: Develop AI/ML based tool that can improve processability of images and derive the outcome,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-415,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02246,US_OMB_2025_02246,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,Troupe Rover Demonstration,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; ARC: Ames Research Center; Science; United States,action plans,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The Troupe Rover demonstration project is implementing an algorithm called ""SafeMAP"" or Safe Multi-Agent Planner. SafeMAP is used in distributed multi-rover or multi-uav system to plan the actions of a group of collaborating agents working on a shared goal.","The Troupe Rover demonstration project is implementing an algorithm called ""SafeMAP"" or Safe Multi-Agent Planner. SafeMAP is used in distributed multi-rover or multi-uav system to plan the actions of a group of collaborating agents working on a shared goal.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-417,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
