AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02302,US_OMB_2025_02302,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,Vlasov Informed Super Resolution (VISR),National Aeronautics and Space Administration; GSFC: Goddard Space Flight Center; Science; United States,Predictions,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Vlasov Informed Super Resolution (VISR),This work uses a physics informed neural network to gain insight into the Vlasov equation (key to plasma physics) based on plasma data from the Magnetospheric Multiscale mission sensors.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-213,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02303,US_OMB_2025_02303,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,Nighttime Combustion Detection from NASA’s Black Marble,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; GSFC: Goddard Space Flight Center; Science; United States,"daily detections, ensemble output.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The ML capability first demonstrates the generation of training samples using anomaly detection, tackling the challenge of training data generation in Earth Sciences. This is followed by classification of combustion and background across diverse geographic reasons and seasons and produces detections from a suite of baseline ML approaches including per-band outlier detections, fully-connected neural networks and Siamese Networks trained with triplet and contrastive loss. The detections are then jointly considered to create a high confidence ensemble detection layer.",This use case focuses on monitoring nighttime combustion over land from NASA’s Black Marble product and has demonstrated the detection of fires and gas flaring mapping by jointly using both thermal and light emission properties of these event.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-410,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02304,US_OMB_2025_02304,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,The On-board Artificial Intelligence Research (OnAIR) Platform,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; GSFC: Goddard Space Flight Center; Science; United States,It provides a flight software analog capable of streaming live telemetry to and receiving commands from experimental code.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"OnAIR is intended to be used by Artificial Intelligence researchers that are exploring how to apply leading edge Artificial Intelligence research to flight software in a simulated environment. For example, a researcher may use OnAIR to develop a proof of concept demonstrating that a specialized technique can diagnose satellite faults in a simulated environment. OnAIR is not intended to be used in flight software.",The On-board Artificial Intelligence Research (OnAIR) Platform is a generalized software framework for performing AI research.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-416,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
