AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02526,US_OMB_2025_02526,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,GenAI Agent for Interacting with Robots (https://github.com/nasa-jpl/rosa),National Aeronautics and Space Administration; JPL: Jet Propulsion Laboratory; Science; United States,answers to user queries,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,ROSA is an AI agent that integrates with the ROS ecosystem to help develop and operate robots using natural language. It is able to read live telemetry data from robotics systems and formulate answers to user queries.,ROSA is an AI agent that integrates with the ROS ecosystem to help develop and operate robots using natural language. It is able to read live telemetry data from robotics systems and formulate answers to user queries.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PILOT,시험·파일럿,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-709,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
