AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02560,US_OMB_2025_02560,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,AMP: An Automated Metadata Pipeline,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; LaRC: Langley Research Center; Science; United States,metadata records,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"In this work, we combine ontologies and machine learning to auto-generate robust, semantically consistent, variable-level metadata records for large NASA satellite collections, and AMPed metadata supports improved data discovery and the AMP (automated data pipeline) provides API (Application Program Interface) access to subsetted data on demand.","In this work, we combine ontologies and machine learning to auto-generate robust, semantically consistent, variable-level metadata records for large NASA satellite collections, and AMPed metadata supports improved data discovery and the AMP (automated data pipeline) provides API (Application Program Interface) access to subsetted data on demand.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-296,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
