AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02616,US_OMB_2025_02616,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,SERVIR Applied Deep Learning Book,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; MSFC: Marshall Space Flight Center; Science; United States,"Data Preparation, Semantic Segmentation, Object Detection, Time Series, Ecological Process Simulations, Transfer Learning, Fusion, Downscaling",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Thereby providing a wide variety of thematic applications to complement reader’s domain specific practical knowledge such as agronomy or forestry etc. We suspect readers are coming to this virtual book with preexisting geospatial expertise. However, limited Deep Learning knowledge and application specifically around environmental and Remote Sensing oriented challenges.","The focus of the Applied Deep Learning Book is to provide practitioners with a wide variety of applied examples of Remote Sensing Deep Learning approaches. With each chapter focusing on a specific problem set such as object detection of downscaling using Deep Learning. Additionally, throughout the books chapters various examples are provided spanning the aforementioned thematic areas.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-506,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
