AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02627,US_OMB_2025_02627,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,Autonomous Navigation Decision Making for Lunar/Martian Rovers,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; MSFC: Marshall Space Flight Center; Science; United States,"execute construction tasks (e.g., berms, landing pad layers, trenching, or feedstock staging for sintering/printing)",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Enable a rover (or rover swarm) to autonomously collect lunar regolith, haul it to a worksite, and execute construction tasks (e.g., berms, landing pad layers, trenching, or feedstock staging for sintering/printing) using AI for perception, mapping, planning, control, and health monitoring.","Enable a rover (or rover swarm) to autonomously collect lunar regolith, haul it to a worksite, and execute construction tasks (e.g., berms, landing pad layers, trenching, or feedstock staging for sintering/printing) using AI for perception, mapping, planning, control, and health monitoring.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-923,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
