AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02637,US_OMB_2025_02637,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,"Object classification, change detection, and anomaly detection in LiDAR and other point cloud datasets.",National Aeronautics and Space Administration; MSFC: Marshall Space Flight Center; Science; United States,"Leveraging AI for point cloud analysis may advance accuracy and efficiency of: • Point cloud classification, enhancing capabilities for LiDAR based autonomy and navigation. • Change detection, enriching scientific investigations of geomorphology and surface processes. • Anomaly detection, enhancing inspection of hardware and monitoring of manufacturing processes.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Leveraging AI for point cloud analysis may advance accuracy and efficiency of: •Point cloud classification, enhancing capabilities for LiDAR based autonomy and navigation. •Change detection, enriching scientific investigations of geomorphology and surface processes. •Anomaly detection, enhancing inspection of hardware and monitoring of manufacturing processes.","Leveraging AI for point cloud analysis may advance accuracy and efficiency of: •Point cloud classification, enhancing capabilities for LiDAR based autonomy and navigation. •Change detection, enriching scientific investigations of geomorphology and surface processes. •Anomaly detection, enhancing inspection of hardware and monitoring of manufacturing processes.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,S4_PREDICTION_DETECTION,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-934,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
