AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02639,US_OMB_2025_02639,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Science,UNKNOWN,Research to Operations Platform,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; MSFC: Marshall Space Flight Center; Science; United States,visualizations,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Platform that leverages foundation models created by NASA IMPACT AI for Science to allow users to inference on the fine-tuned models and visualize the results,Platform that leverages foundation models created by NASA IMPACT AI for Science to allow users to inference on the fine-tuned models and visualize the results,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-936,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02640,US_OMB_2025_02640,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,National Aeronautics and Space Administration,Law Enforcement,"The purpose is to enhance situational awareness, reduce manual effort, and improve response times while also enabling organizations to repurpose video data for business and safety improvements.",Intelligent Camera Analytics for Security and Operations,National Aeronautics and Space Administration; OPS: Office of Protective Services; Law Enforcement; United States,"The AI system generates real-time outputs such as object detections, activity classifications, and anomaly alerts. These may include identifying people, vehicles, or objects of interest; detecting unusual behaviors like loitering or perimeter breaches; and flagging safety or security incidents for operator review. The system can also produce analytics dashboards and reports, summarizing trends such as occupancy levels, traffic flow, and space utilization, which support both security response and operational decision-making.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"By leveraging AI-driven video surveillance, organizations can significantly improve efficiency and security outcomes. Automated monitoring reduces the need for constant human oversight, lowering operational costs while also decreasing the likelihood of missed incidents. Faster and more accurate detection of anomalies—such as unauthorized access, unattended objects, or unusual behavior—enhances safety for personnel and protects critical assets. In addition, video analytics provide valuable secondary benefits, including occupancy tracking, traffic flow analysis, and facility utilization insights that support data-driven decision-making. These capabilities enable scalability without requiring proportional increases in staffing, delivering measurable return on investment through reduced false alarms, quicker response times, improved compliance with safety protocols, and optimized use of resources.","Traditional video surveillance requires continuous human monitoring, which is resource-intensive and prone to missed events. By applying AI-driven camera analytics, this use case addresses the need for faster, more reliable detection of security incidents and operational insights. The purpose is to enhance situational awareness, reduce manual effort, and improve response times while also enabling organizations to repurpose video data for business and safety improvements.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,NASA-753,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
