AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02711,US_OMB_2025_02711,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""enterprise_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Small Business Administration,IT,Non-technical business users struggle to explore data and create visualizations without extensive training. Creating comprehensive documentation for data assets requires manual effort.,Data Analysis and Visualization AI,Small Business Administration; OCFO: Office of the Chief Financial Officer; IT; United States,"Generative AI-powered analytics assistant integrated into Tableau that helps analysts explore data, create visualizations, and uncover insights through conversational natural language. Uses NLP and generative AI to transform natural language questions into calculations, visualizations, and data stories. Accelerates data preparation with AI-assisted cleaning and mapping. Automates semantic modeling with AI recommendations. Generates comprehensive data asset descriptions. Provides context-aware assistance, proactive anomaly detection, and guided calculation creation. Input: natural language queries, data sources, dashboards. Output: automated visualizations, calculated fields, data narratives, insight summaries, trend analysis, and interactive dashboards.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Accelerates data analysis with natural language queries that instantly generate visualizations and calculations. Reduces time spent on data preparation through AI-assisted cleaning and mapping automation. Simplifies complex analysis by converting natural language prompts into accurate calculations and visualizations. Democratizes data access for non-technical users through conversational data exploration. Automates data documentation generation for data sources, workbooks, and tables. Provides proactive context-aware insights by identifying patterns and anomalies. Generates natural language data stories that explain visualizations. Enhances decision-making speed and quality with AI-powered insights. Built on Einstein Trust Layer ensuring security, governance, and data privacy.","Data analysts spend significant time on repetitive tasks like data cleaning, semantic modeling, calculation creation, and generating data narratives. Non-technical business users struggle to explore data and create visualizations without extensive training. Translating complex datasets into actionable insights is time-consuming. Creating comprehensive documentation for data assets requires manual effort. Identifying trends, anomalies, and meaningful patterns in large datasets is labor-intensive.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,SBA-32,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
