AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02932,US_OMB_2025_02932,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of the Treasury,Admin Functions,UNKNOWN,Ask-CFO Research Aide,Department of the Treasury; Internal Revenue Service (IRS); Admin Functions; United States,"This system uses an embedding model to produce a vector representation of texts for contextual searching, and Large Language Model to generate a response to user inquiries. Outputs of the tool include the model generated response to a user's inquiry, as well as the text from relevant documents identified in the retrieval stage and used by the model in generating said response.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,This will help CFO users search and obtain information from their repository of relevant documents.,"Ask-CFO is an extension of the Research Aide developed using a COTS platform originally designed for the Joint Committee on Taxation Research Aide (JCR) and Internal Revenue Manual Research Aid (IRMA) use cases. It is a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) search on a number of Chief Financial Officer (CFO) specific documents. In addition to the existing research aide capability and user interface (UI), extensions will be developed to incorporate AI Agents that can perform actions such as document summary comparison over fiscal year, or extract information from tables.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,S1_KNOWLEDGE_RETRIEVAL_RAG|S3_DOCUMENT_INTELLIGENCE,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,TREAS-129,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02933,US_OMB_2025_02933,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""education_research""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of the Treasury,Admin Functions,"This will positively benefit IRS-CI by operationalizing functional LLM tools for our agency, reducing the administrative burden and increasing access to a shared agency knowledge base.",Sandbox for Large Language Model Research,Department of the Treasury; Internal Revenue Service (IRS); Admin Functions; United States,Use case dependent.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The sandbox will benefit our agency by enabling IRS-CI to research, test, and customize LLM AI tools to increase operational efficiencies within IRS-CI. This will positively benefit IRS-CI by operationalizing functional LLM tools for our agency, reducing the administrative burden and increasing access to a shared agency knowledge base.","This sandbox would enable IRS Criminal Investigation (CI) to research, test, and customize Large Language Model (LLM) AI tools to increase operational efficiencies within IRS-CI. This will positively benefit IRS-CI by operationalizing functional LLM tools for our agency, reducing the administrative burden and increasing access to a shared agency knowledge base.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,TREAS-140,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
