AXALL_US_OMB_2025_02985,US_OMB_2025_02985,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work"", ""enterprise_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of the Treasury,Admin Functions,"This project utilizes Large Language Model (LLM) to produce a library of IRS business process maps and optionally integrate them into knowledge graphs based on Internal Revenue Manual (IRM), the IRS processing codes (Document 6209) and other pertinent documents.",AI Assisted Business Process Mapping,Department of the Treasury; Internal Revenue Service (IRS); Admin Functions; United States,Business process maps in standard BPMN (Business Process Model and Notation) or knowledge graph.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"This is for the IRS internal use to drive efficiency by mapping processes and helping identifying bottlenecks along the way. The library of the business process map will be a good companion to IRM, Document 6209 and valuable resources to the IRS employees.","This project utilizes Large Language Model (LLM) to produce a library of IRS business process maps and optionally integrate them into knowledge graphs based on Internal Revenue Manual (IRM), the IRS processing codes (Document 6209) and other pertinent documents. In addition, a custom tool will assist users with prompt engineering to drill down on a specific business area with additional desktop guides and standard operating procedures (SOPs).",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,TREAS-IRS-96,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
