AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03096,US_OMB_2025_03096,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Agriculture,Service Delivery,UNKNOWN,Cover Crop Mapping,Department of Agriculture; Farm Production and Conservation; Service Delivery; United States,"The output is a state-level map of detected cover crops by year, classified by planting date (fall, spring).",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Benefits by helping the agency independently check and track how many farmers are using cover crops, reducing the need for on-site visits to determine if cover crops are present on a field.",The agency needs to independently check and track the use of cover crops on farms. Yearly maps are made using satellite images and models of plant growth to measure the use of cover crops on farms in the U.S. Midwest.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,USDA-061,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03097,US_OMB_2025_03097,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Agriculture,Service Delivery,UNKNOWN,Planting Date Detection,Department of Agriculture; Farm Production and Conservation; Service Delivery; United States,"The output is an annual map of planting dates for corn, soybean, and winter wheat.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"This data helps the agency independently check and confirm the planting dates reported by farmers to ensure the integrity of their programs, reducing the need for on-site visits to determine when a field was planted.","The agency needs to independently check and confirm the planting dates reported by farmers to ensure the integrity of their programs. Maps containing planting dates are made using satellite images and models of plant growth, which help to find out the planting dates for corn, soybean, and winter wheat on farms in the U.S. Midwest.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,USDA-062,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
