AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03290,US_OMB_2025_03290,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Veterans Affairs,Benefits Processing,UNKNOWN,BillieGPT POC,Department of Veterans Affairs; OIT: Office of Information & Technology; Benefits Processing; United States,Generative AI response to the user question,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Better outcomes for student veterans, increased efficiency","It will exist to assist School employees (School certifying officials) in general use, policy, and procedures for handling Veterans cases from the school's perspective. Gives info directly to school officials rather than having them call in to the VA call centers for assistance.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,VA-25-605,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03291,US_OMB_2025_03291,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Veterans Affairs,IT,"Currently, teams manually review and update Knowledge Articles, often without clear prioritization.",ECC Automated Knowledge Management,Department of Veterans Affairs; OIT: Office of Information & Technology; IT; United States,The MVP is planned in 2 phases with different outputs. The 1st phase of the MVP is to produce a prioritized list of knowledge articles for the Integration and Sustainment team to modify based on inputs from multiple data sources. The 2nd phase of the MVP will output a complete knowledge article that will be reviewed by a person for accuracy and completeness.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"This initiative is expected to improve efficiency by 20% in the Minimum Viable Product (MVP), and grow as the agent creates and modifies knowledge.","Currently, teams manually review and update Knowledge Articles, often without clear prioritization. This leads to rework, inefficiencies, and missed opportunities to align knowledge with real-time service changes. An AI-driven approach will streamline this process and ensure knowledge is kept current and relevant.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,F01_REPETITIVE_MANUAL_WORK,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,VA-25-6170,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03292,US_OMB_2025_03292,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Veterans Affairs,IT,UNKNOWN,Custom GPT for Network Operations and Automation (Wide Area Network),Department of Veterans Affairs; OIT: Office of Information & Technology; IT; United States,"Router configurations, Troubleshooting information, information pertaining to our devices, security compliance checks, answers to leaderships questions, training information to new employees.",UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Benefits: • Reduced mean time to resolution for network issues • Standardized configuration generation reducing human error • Enhanced knowledge sharing across the WAN team • 24/7 availability for network operations support • Improved training resource for new team members,"This solution will be able to: 1. Information Retrieval: Query our router database and backup configurations to answer questions about network topology, device status, and configuration details 2. Configuration Generation: Assist in building network device configurations based on our standards and requirements 3. Troubleshooting Support: Help diagnose network outages by analyzing device data and providing guided troubleshooting steps 4. Read-Only Device Access: Eventually integrate with our network infrastructure to gather real-time information from devices in a secure, read-only manner It will solve the problem of reducing the time required to resolve network issues, human errors in configuration, availability of network support.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,PRE_DEPLOYMENT,도입 전,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,VA-25-6585,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,Fa