AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03323,US_OMB_2025_03323,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Veterans Affairs,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,Evolv WDS - OSLE,"Department of Veterans Affairs; OSP: Office of Operations, Security, and Preparedness; Law Enforcement; United States",AI is used to conduct scans of objects in the shapes of weapons then develops maps of the body to display the location and shape of the object.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"Occupant screening for weapons to ensure that facilities are creating a safe and secure environment for Veterans, Visitors, and Employees.",AI driven security screening system designed to detect concealed weapons and threats in high-traffic areas. AI is used to conduct scans of objects in the shapes of weapons then develops maps of the body to display the location and shape of the object.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,VA-24-36,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03324,US_OMB_2025_03324,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Veterans Affairs,Law Enforcement,UNKNOWN,Avigilon Camera/Search Function - OSSO,"Department of Veterans Affairs; OSP: Office of Operations, Security, and Preparedness; Law Enforcement; United States",Video or images of requested searches from the video surveillance systems.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,"The integration of artificial intelligence (AI) into VA Police operations has significantly enhanced efficiency and response capabilities. Traditionally, personnel were required to manually review recorded video and images which was a time-consuming process. With AI, these records can now be autonomously searched, drastically reducing manpower hours. Moreover, during emergent situations, AI has proven instrumental in locating persons of interest, such as missing individuals or patients. This capability has greatly improved the VA Police’s ability to respond swiftly and effectively, ultimately enhancing safety and operational readiness.",A search function in a security video surveillance system that searches for points of interest in the video.,SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,VA-24-77,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
