AXALL_US_OMB_2025_03508,US_OMB_2025_03508,SOURCE_REPORTED_USE_CASE,SOURCE_REPORTED_PROJECT_OR_USE_CASE,U.S. Office of Management and Budget,public_work,공공기관·공공서비스,"[""public_work""]",PUBLIC_AGENCY,Department of Veterans Affairs,Health and Medical,UNKNOWN,BioPlex 2200 ANA Screen with Medical Decision Support Software for Use with BioPlex 2200 Multi-Analyte Detection System,Department of Veterans Affairs; VHA: Veterans Health Administration; Health and Medical; United States,The MDSS can suggest one or more possible disease associations after identifying patterns from antibody results.,UNKNOWN; 원천의 기대효과와 별도 관측 성과는 구분해야 합니다.,Support antibody screening procedures.,"The BioPlex 2200 Medical Decision Support Software (MDSS) is a pattern recognition algorithm that can enhance the performance of the Antinuclear Antibody (ANA) Screening associated diagnostic patterns, among its multiple assay results.",SOURCE_CLASSIFIED_AI,DEPLOYED,원천 보고: 운영,,S5_OPTIMIZATION_DECISION_SUPPORT,https://github.com/ombegov/2025-Federal-Agency-AI-Use-Case-Inventory,VA-24-5714,U.S. federal public inventory; no separate repository LICENSE found; retain source attribution and review redistribution conditions,SOURCE_REPORTED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED,STRUCTURED_SOURCE_ROW_CHECKED,True,2.5.0-inclusive,False
